<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="750" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BBC10" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: none; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BB090"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BE470"><td data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BDE80" style="line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BDFB0" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0D770"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0E810"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0F190" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0F3F0" style="background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0F650"><tr width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0F8B0"><td align="center" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F10B20" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; height: 60px; width: 680px;"><div data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0FB10" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BBFA0" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn Points. Save on Flights. Manage Travel</font></div><div data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BE340" style="height: 15px; line-height: 15px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BEF10" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167B8CE0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167B8F40"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0E350" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QBR_eDM_Banner.jpg" title="Qantas Business Rewards" style="width: 680px;"></font></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F115B0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F11350"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0E0F0"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0DE90" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0DC30"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0D9D0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0E5B0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F1B70" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F1DD0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F2030" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0EA70"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0ECD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BBA1410"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BBA1670" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks for your time today, it was great to catch up and discuss how your business is engaging with the Qantas Business Rewards program. Through our interactions, we've discussed a range of program features and how your business can maximise the benefits of the program.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BB680"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BB8C0">Given&nbsp;<mark data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0BEC0">XXX's</mark>&nbsp;engagement with the program, I'll look to schedule recurring review meetings with you on a half-yearly basis. The purpose of these meetings will be to discuss general Qantas updates, review how your business is engaging with the program and share any areas of opportunity for your business to obtain additional value from the program.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BB9D0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BF2A0">As agreed in our discussion today, I have locked in&nbsp;<mark data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F09FB0">XXXX</mark>&nbsp;for our next catch up. If you need any assistance, please feel free to contact myself or my team via&nbsp;<a href="mailtio:corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0BA00" style="color: rgb(223, 0, 0); border: 0px;">corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au</a>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BF4E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167BF850">I have included an overview of the benefits available to you below, as well as some relevant contact numbers.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0AEA0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0A8D0"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BBA0F60"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016D20410"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167C0650">**If you have not already shared either the Agent Toolkit or the Customer Toolkit please also share this with the customer based on their booking behaviour. If direct just share the customer one, if Indirect or mixed Indirect/Direct then also include the Agent Toolkit**</strong></em></mark><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0A7C0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0A580"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="00000000187A3840"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016D20670"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167C0190">**If customer uses TMC (review HCF)**</strong></em></mark><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0A470">As your business make bookings via a Travel Agent, I have attached a Qantas Business Rewards Agent Toolkit that can be shared with your agent to support them in accessing these benefits on your behalf. I have also included a customer version should you wish to reference a more detailed overview of your program benefits.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F093F0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F07C50"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="00000000167C03F0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016D23F10"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F1200">**If customer is direct (review HCF)**</strong></em></mark><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F07A10">I have attached a Qantas Business Rewards Customer Toolkit that you can reference for a complete overview of your program benefits.</font><ul data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BBA0D00" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016D24170" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/qbr/myaccount" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0C120" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Your Qantas Business Rewards Account</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F0B7A0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-and-save-on-flights.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B7E20D0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards flying benefits</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="00000000195313E0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/save-on-qantas-club.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B7DEAC0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards exclusive Qantas Club discount</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B7DE090" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/gold-accelerator.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B7DD4B0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Exclusive Qantas Business Rewards Level 3 Gold Accelerator</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B7DD710" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/earn-points-on-business-expenses.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019532CD0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Earn points on business expenses through our 50+ partners</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B7DBE20" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides/stored-travellers.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F5FC0" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">How to make the most out of the stored traveller feature</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F6220" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/news/how-to-guides.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F05470" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards How-To Guides</font></a></li><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F056D0" style="margin: 15px 0px 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/faqs.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F08A70" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards FAQs</font></a></li></ul></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F080F0"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F08350" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F07570"></font><hr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F07460" style="height: 2px; border-width: 0px; color: rgb(218, 218, 218); background-color: rgb(218, 218, 218);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F07220"></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F062B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F077B0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F068A0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F06180"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F06770" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F06C30"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F08810"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F05930" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-flights.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F04D80" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BFC180" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F04A10"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F03020" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F09190"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF79A0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F6930" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F6DF0">Save on flights</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000018F047D0">Take your business even further for less, with up to 10% savings on eligible domestic and international fares to over 1,300 destinations with Qantas,&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7F6B90">one</strong>world<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7FA8C0" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">®</sup>&nbsp;and partner airlines<sup data_liveedit_tagid="000000001E7FAB20" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">~</sup>. Plus, enjoy a range of exclusive offers on top of your year-round member savings on international and domestic flights for even more value.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF7C00"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF7E60" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BFAE90"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF80C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="50px" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BFA400"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BFA660"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BFB220" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF9F40"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BFA1A0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF5640" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; height: 50px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/icon-points.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019348170" style="margin: 0px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF58A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193483B0"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF60D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF7030"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF53E0"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BF10D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BEFE00">Earn Qantas Points</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193484C0">Earn points* for your business on top of the points and Status Credits you and your employees earn as a Frequent Flyer<sup data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BEEB30" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 8px;">#</sup>. As a Level 3 member, you can earn 40 Qantas Points for your business for every 100 points your flyers earn. Plus, book a hotel through your Business Account and earn even more - up to 6 points per $1 spent (3 points for the business, and 3 points for the Frequent Flyer.)</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BEE1B0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000016BEE410" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB7B20"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB7D80" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB7FE0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB94E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB78C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFADC10"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFADE70"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFAE0D0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-business-account-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019525E50" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB1BA0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019526090"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BFB1E00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019343A60"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019343340"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019343470" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019343930">Business travel</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000195262D0">Easily book and manage flights, hotels and car hire directly from your Business Account. All the Qantas Points your business earns on Qantas and Jetstar flights, Qantas hotels and car hire count towards your membership level, making it easier to retain your Level 3 savings and benefits.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019343DF0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019348960" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 25px; height: 25px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019348BC0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019347170" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019349080"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000193492E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019525860" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019526870"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019526AD0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000195270A0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px;"><img src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/icons/qbr-icon-reporting-48x48.png" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001BBA5310" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: none; display: block; width: 48px;"></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019527300" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; width: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019526C00"></font></td><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001952BC40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; vertical-align: top; padding: 0px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019529EB0"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001952A110"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001952C5C0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001952B9E0">Access real-time reporting and set your business' travel policy</strong><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019527560">Gain valuable insights into your team’s booking behaviour and track your travel spend, policy compliance and easily download expense reports, along with creating and managing your business’ travel policy.</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019532810"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019531B00" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14